# A forester plants a sapling on a free meadow node near his building, on layouts/forester.jsonc.
# Run it on the layout: sh tools/play-run.sh forester --layout layouts/forester.jsonc --fps 10
# The castle stands at 10,10, so its flag is at 11,11. The forester's building at 13,10 has its flag at 14,11, a road of three steps
# leads west to the castle's flag, and his worker stands inside. He searches the nodes around the building, walks to a free one,
# waits, and puts a sapling down.
wait 0.3
expect-at 13 10 building
expect-at 14 11 flag
expect-count sapling = 0
shot placed 13 10 1 2

fast-forward until count sapling >= 1 max 20000
wait 0.3
expect-count sapling >= 1
dump sapling-planted
shot sapling-planted 13 10 1 2
